/ActualText (        Aakam360 has been a leading platform for providing  Enabling students to acquire industry knowledge and bridge the gap between Industry and Institute.As part of our commitment to continuous improvement, we aim to enhance user engagement and experience by introducing two new features: a chatbot and feedback videos.A chatbot designed to provide instant support   and feedback videos aimed at capturing detailed user insights. These additions will not only streamline user interactions but also provide valuable insights into user satisfaction and areas for further improvement. )
/Pg 8 0 R
/K [3]
>>
